 1317:    // An example of how to use these functions is:
 1318:    //   
 1319:    //    getNodalValues(L, &Node::compZCoord, zLAtNodes);
 1320:    // 
 1321:    // Where L is the level at which the field is to be interpolated. The field can be either
 1322:    // a double (depth), an array (u[nvrt]), or a function that depends on the level (Node::compZCoord(int k)). 
 1323:    // There are different versions of getNodalValues for each of these cases.
 1324: 
